\item[S2] Daniel Frohardt, Robert Guralnick and Kay Magaard, \emph{Primitive Monodromy Groups of Genus at most Two}, arXiv:1401.1303 (2014). Introduction and Definition1, pages1--2. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/1401.1303}.
